  "worked_solution": "First, to get the minor of ${x}_{52}$, we remove the $5$th row and $2$nd column: \n\n$$\nX=[\\begin{aligned}1 & \u2217 & 2 & -5 & -1 \\\\ 3 & \u2217 & 6 & 3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & \u2217 & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 4 & \u2217 & 3 & 8 & 3 \\\\ \u2217 & 3 & \u2217 & \u2217 & \u2217\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor is \n\n$$\n{M}_{52}=|\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -5 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 6 & 3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 4 & 3 & 8 & 3\\end{aligned}|.\n$$\n\nNow, the cofactor of ${x}_{52}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}_{52} & =(-1)^{5+2}{M}_{52} \\\\  & =-{M}_{52} \\\\  & =-|\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -5 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 6 & 3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 4 & 3 & 8 & 3\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
